# Build output of this xUnit project. The plugin-root .gitignore's `/[Oo]bj/` rule is ROOTED at
# Unity-MCP-Plugin/, so it does not reach here, and nothing ignores `bin/` or `TestResults/` at all —
# without this file a `git add -A` after a local `dotnet test` would commit the whole restore output.
bin/
obj/
TestResults/
